 \textbf{Contributions.}
 \begin{enumerate}\itemsep1pt\topsep2pt\parsep0pt
 \item \textbf{A conservation law (\S\ref{sec:price}).} Along any stationary exploration policy, $\Var(\hat\eps)\times C_T = \tfrac{1}{2}\gpo\sigma^2$: slope uncertainty times cumulative performative regret is a policy-independent invariant (Theorem~\ref{thm:exchange}). The anchoring is delicate: anchored at the performative optimum instead, the product is \emph{false}, inflated by a verified factor.
